 * apps/examples/xiaozhi_voice/xiaozhi_main.c
 *
 * Xiaozhi AI Voice App — Phase 2 entry point.
 *
 * Full dialog: OTA -> wss connect -> hello -> listen start -> mic capture
 * (Opus uplink) -> listen stop -> receive stt/tts -> TTS Opus playback.
 *
